,"body":"Still looking for suggestions and a accept/ decline.","body_tagged":"Still looking for suggestions and a accept/ decline.","created_at":1435192435},{"id":201614,"author":"Zintenka","body":"The map looks like it'll have good gameplay however, the amount of OP stuff in the chests is sort of staggering but as long as both teams have access to it. Then its fine.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt is recommended that you use a website like Pastie or Pastebin (Pastie recommended) to post your YML. I don't wish to download YML when it is easier to look at it on a website :P\u003cbr\u003eCopy and paste your YML into Pastie then provide us a link ;)","body_tagged":"The map looks like it'll have good gameplay however, the amount of OP stuff in the chests is sort of staggering but as long as both teams have access to it. Then its fine.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt is recommended that you use a website like Pastie or Pastebin (Pastie recommended) to post your YML. I don't wish to download YML when it is easier to look at it on a website :P\u003cbr\u003eCopy and paste your YML into Pastie then provide us a link ;)","created_at":1435195361},{"id":201620,"author":"dilpickel","body":"Here you go\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://pastebin.com/y4rWSjHh\" title=\"Link: http://pastebin.com/y4rWSjHh\"\u003ehttp://pastebin.com/y4rWSjHh\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThat was a lot easier then making a download, I'll do that from now on thanks!","body_tagged":"Here you go\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://pastebin.com/y4rWSjHh\" title=\"Link: http://pastebin.com/y4rWSjHh\"\u003ehttp://pastebin.com/y4rWSjHh\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThat was a lot easier then making a download, I'll do that from now on thanks!","created_at":1435195691},{"id":201623,"author":"Zintenka","body":"No problem bro, if you need any more help let meh know ;)","body_tagged":"No problem bro, if you need any more help let meh know ;)","created_at":1435196360,"reply_to":201620},{"id":201628,"author":"Zintenka","bod